{"id":"677e7c9793466351","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-disjoint-dense-sets.md","title":"两个稠密集合的交可以为空","display":"ex-disjoint-dense-sets — 两个稠密集合的交可以为空","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-disjoint-dense-sets","aliases":["20-ex-disjoint-dense-sets"],"display":"ex-disjoint-dense-sets — 两个稠密集合的交可以为空","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 14.1.4","source_printed_pages":[213],"source_pdf_pages":[242],"depends_on":["[[20-df-category]]","[[20-thm-category-laws]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-disjoint-dense-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-disjoint-dense-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-disjoint-dense-sets — 两个稠密集合的交可以为空"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 14.1.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8485bd5a48a9fe0\" href=\"?note=a8485bd5a48a9fe0\" title=\"20-thm-category-laws\">20-thm-category-laws</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\exists n\\ \\forall m\\ge n\\ X(m)=i\\}\">\\(A_i=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\exists n\\ \\forall m\\ge n\\ X(m)=i\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a8485bd5a48a9fe0\" href=\"?note=a8485bd5a48a9fe0\" title=\"20-thm-category-laws\">20-thm-category-laws</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}disjoint-dense-sets}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Dense}(A_0)\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(A_1)\\land A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}disjoint-dense-sets}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Dense}(A_0)\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(A_1)\\land A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任何有限串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 可接上全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 尾部，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 与每个柱相交。一个序列不能同时最终为 0 和最终为 1；两集不交。它们都可数且 meager，说明 Baire 定理中的“稠密开”不能只保留稠密。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 213 / PDF 242。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-category-laws","status":"resolved","id":"a8485bd5a48a9fe0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-category-laws]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-category-laws]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-category-laws","status":"resolved","id":"a8485bd5a48a9fe0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-category-laws]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A_i=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\exists n\\ \\forall m\\ge n\\ X(m)=i\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}disjoint-dense-sets}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Dense}(A_0)\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(A_1)\\land A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"A_i","display":false}],"bytes":1187,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-disjoint-dense-sets]] — 章 14；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-ex-disjoint-dense-sets]]"}],"outgoing":["e3e4bc829c39df8c","a8485bd5a48a9fe0"]}